From b7334572a5651c9f2d90bcafd11fab1764e0de1d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artem Fesunenko <body051@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 16:06:58 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] scripts: Add lerdge_mirror.py to show KlipperScreen on
 Lerdge TFTs

Mirror an Xvfb display to the lerdge_tft module: changed regions are
RLE encoded and sent through the Klipper API socket, and touch gestures
are injected into X as clicks, mouse wheel scrolling and holds.  Knob
(encoder) events become keyboard navigation (Tab, Return, Escape).
While printing, the display traffic is kept below a share of the MCU
link bandwidth.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
